[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=6 format=3]

; The one Tarrock UI theme: the U1 parchment/ink/gold palette, as a Theme resource.
; art-audio.md Visual pillar 3 asks for illuminated-manuscript framing on ALL chrome,
; so the framing itself is NinePatch art (see the .svg files beside this file) and this
; resource carries only what a Theme can carry: colours, sizes, and the flat plates
; behind buttons. Fonts are Godot's default until the art lane picks one - see
; res://art/ui/README.md, ART REQUESTS.

[sub_resource type="StyleBoxFlat" id="StyleBoxFlat_button_normal"]
